        "internal/live/channel/input_bindings_test.go",
        "internal/live/channel/input_attempt_test.go",
        "internal/live/channel/native_diagnostics_windows_test.go"
      ],
      "assertionScope": "No Escape/old Transport. Only current capability for Invoke; previous actual two-key INPUT may Reload. Legacy 200-slot identity preserves incompatible/manual activation classification. Receipt probe is one named INPUT read per exchange, no witness/consumption authority. Discovery stays untrusted and candidate filtering preserves Go actor/build/product/release/runtime ordering.",
